0 TEMPO LOOP - one-motor double-crank speed modulator
0 Name: tempo-loop.ldr
0 Author: Brickwright contributors; ChatGPT-assisted original assembly
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../LICENSE-BSD-3-Clause.txt
0 // SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
0 // Mounting patterns: Copyright (c) 2026, Christian Stroebele (CrispStrobe).
0 // AD=40, AB=80, BC=DC=100 LDU. 20 LDU = 8 mm.
0 // Ground AD is shortest: 40+100 < 80+100, strict Grashof double crank.
0 // Reset: A=(0,0), B=(80,0), D=(40,0), C=(60,-sqrt(9600)).
0 // Red input/yellow coupler/blue output at z=60/80/100.
0 // Output bearing posts at z=120 and 140 are entirely in front of the linkage.
0 // Coupler holes -60 and +40 are 100 LDU apart; the last hole is an overhang.
0 // All constraints use actual pins and holes. No custom !BW joint tags.
0 // 1. Pinned ladder base, exact 6-8-10 diagonal and left landing skid
